		<dc:creator><![CDATA[wpdc@20248]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 02 Dec 2024 03:11:28 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">http://filter.philitee.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=4367</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Flat air filters are commonly used in HVAC systems, automotive engines, and industrial air filtration applications. These filters are designed to trap airborne particles, including dust, pollen, and other contaminants, improving air quality.
<ul>
 	<li><strong>Frame Materia</strong>l: Galvanized Sheet, Stainless Steel, Aluminum Sheet.</li>
 	<li><strong>Filter Media</strong>: Fiberglass, Polyester or Synthetic Fiber, Cotton, Activated Carbon, Electrostatic Media, HEPA (High-Efficiency Particulate Air) Material.</li>
 	<li><strong>Size</strong>: Customized.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[		<div data-elementor-type="product-post" data-elementor-id="4367" class="elementor elementor-4367" data-elementor-post-type="product">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4d173f8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="4d173f8" data-element_type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a0d2c21 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="a0d2c21" data-element_type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-588672e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="588672e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
										<figure class="wp-caption">
										<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="400" height="400" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/flat-air-filter-frame-detail1.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-4377" alt="" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/flat-air-filter-frame-detail1.jpg 400w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/flat-air-filter-frame-detail1-300x300.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/flat-air-filter-frame-detail1-150x150.jpg 150w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/flat-air-filter-frame-detail1-100x100.jpg 100w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" />											<figcaption class="widget-image-caption wp-caption-text">The frame of flat air filters is made of aluminum alloy or galvanized steel, and the bracket is made of high-strength cold-drawn aluminum wire. The filter structure is firm and not easy to deform. The outer frame and bracket can be reused. The future maintenance only needs to replace the filter element, which greatly reduces the operating cost.</figcaption>
										</figure>
							</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2ddccc0 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="2ddccc0" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
										<figure class="wp-caption">
										<img decoding="async" width="400" height="400" src="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/flat-air-filter-filter-materials-detail2.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-4378" alt="" srcset="https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/flat-air-filter-filter-materials-detail2.jpg 400w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/flat-air-filter-filter-materials-detail2-300x300.jpg 300w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/flat-air-filter-filter-materials-detail2-150x150.jpg 150w, https://filter.philitee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/flat-air-filter-filter-materials-detail2-100x100.jpg 100w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" />											<figcaption class="widget-image-caption wp-caption-text">The frame of flat air filters is made of aluminum alloy or galvanized steel, and the bracket is made of high-strength cold-drawn aluminum wire. The filter structure is firm and not easy to deform. The outer frame and bracket can be reused. The future maintenance only needs to replace the filter element, which greatly reduces the operating cost.</figcaption>
										</figure>
							</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3ad8f50 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3ad8f50" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<h3>Common Size</h3><table cellspacing="1" cellpadding="1"><tbody><tr><td>Nominal Size (inches)</td><td>Actual Size (mm)</td><td>Rated Airflow (m/s)</td><td>Initial Pressure (Pa)</td><td>Final Pressure (Pa)</td><td>AVerage arrestance  (%)</td><td>Filter Object (um)</td><td>Filtration class</td></tr><tr><td>12*24*2</td><td>295*595*46</td><td>1600</td><td>&lt;40</td><td>≤250</td><td>95</td><td>≥5</td><td>G4</td></tr><tr><td>20*20*2</td><td>495*495*46</td><td>2200</td><td>&lt;40</td><td>≤250</td><td>95</td><td>≥5</td><td>G4</td></tr><tr><td>20*24*2</td><td>495*595*46</td><td>2700</td><td>&lt;40</td><td>≤250</td><td>95</td><td>≥5</td><td>G4</td></tr><tr><td>24*24*2</td><td>595*595*46</td><td>3200</td><td>&lt;40</td><td>≤250</td><td>95</td><td>≥5</td><td>G4</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Filter Media and Performance</h3><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td id="sjs-A1" width="115" data-t="s" data-v="Material"><strong>Material</strong></td><td id="sjs-B1" width="289" data-t="s" data-v="Properties"><strong>Properties</strong></td><td id="sjs-C1" width="85" data-t="s" data-v="Applications"><strong>Applications</strong></td><td id="sjs-D1" width="406" data-t="s" data-v="Advantages"><strong>Advantages</strong></td><td id="sjs-E1" width="101" data-t="s" data-v="Limitations">Limitations</td></tr><tr><td id="sjs-A2" data-t="s" data-v="Fiberglass"><strong>Fiberglass</strong></td><td id="sjs-B2" data-t="s" data-v="Made from fine,">Made from fine,spun glassfibers. Lowefficiency.</td><td id="sjs-C2" data-t="s" data-v="Basic residential HVAC systems.">Basic residential HVAC systems.</td><td id="sjs-D2" data-t="s" data-v="Inexpensive, lightweight.">Inexpensive, lightweight.</td><td id="sjs-E2" data-t="s" data-v="Poor at trapping small particles, low efficiency.">Poor at trapping small particles, low efficiency.</td></tr><tr><td id="sjs-A6" data-t="s" data-v="Polyester/Synthetic Fiber"><strong>Polyester/Synthetic</strong> <strong>Fiber</strong></td><td id="sjs-B6" data-t="s" data-v="Woven or bonded synthetic fibers. Higher efficiency than fiberglass.">Woven or bonded synthetic fibers. Higher efficiency than fiberglass.</td><td id="sjs-C6" data-t="s" data-v="Residential, commercial HVAC, automotive filters.">Residential, commercial HVAC, automotive filters.</td><td id="sjs-D6" data-t="s" data-v="Durable, effective">Durable, effectivefor smallerparticles,pleatable formore surfacearea.</td><td id="sjs-E6" data-t="s" data-v="More expensive, needs regular replacement.">More expensive, needs regular replacement.</td></tr><tr><td id="sjs-A12" data-t="s" data-v="Cotton"><strong>Cotton</strong></td><td id="sjs-B12" data-t="s" data-v="Natural fiber, often woven or bonded.">Natural fiber, often woven or bonded.</td><td id="sjs-C12" data-t="s" data-v="Some residential, industrial filters.">Some residential, industrial filters.</td><td id="sjs-D12" data-t="s" data-v="Environmentally friendly, reusable in some cases.">Environmentally friendly, reusable in some cases.</td><td id="sjs-E12" data-t="s" data-v="Less effective for fine particles compared to synthetics.">Less effective for fine particles compared to synthetics.</td></tr><tr><td id="sjs-A13" data-t="s" data-v="Activated Carbon"><strong>Activated Carbon</strong></td><td id="sjs-B13" data-t="s" data-v="Carbon granules combined with fiber. Absorbs odors and VOCs.">Carbon granules combined with fiber. Absorbs odors and VOCs.</td><td id="sjs-C13" data-t="s" data-v="Areas with strong odors or chemicals (e.g., kitchens).">Areas with strong odors or chemicals (e.g., kitchens).</td><td id="sjs-D13" data-t="s" data-v="Odor removal,">Odor removal,VOC absorption.</td><td id="sjs-E13" data-t="s" data-v="Requires">Requires frequent replacement, higher cost.</td></tr><tr><td id="sjs-A18" data-t="s" data-v="Electrostatic Media"><strong>Electrostatic Media</strong></td><td id="sjs-B18" data-t="s" data-v="Synthetic fibers with">Synthetic fibers with electrostatic charge that traps fine particles.</td><td id="sjs-C18" data-t="s" data-v="Residential, commercial HVAC for improved air quality.">Residential, commercial HVAC for improved air quality.</td><td id="sjs-D18" data-t="s" data-v="Can capture fine">Can capture fineparticles, reusableoptions available.</td><td id="sjs-E18" data-t="s" data-v="Requires washing to maintain effectiveness.">Requires washing to maintain effectiveness.</td></tr><tr><td id="sjs-A23" data-t="s" data-v="HEPA Material"><strong>HEPA Material</strong></td><td id="sjs-B23" data-t="s" data-v="Dense layer of fibers, typically">Dense layer of fibers, typically fiberglass or synthetic. Captures 99.97% of particles 0.3microns or larger.</td><td id="sjs-C23" data-t="s" data-v="Clean rooms, medical facilities, high- efficiency purifiers, ↓">Clean rooms, medical facilities, high-efficiency purifiers,</td><td id="sjs-D23" data-t="s" data-v="Very high filtration efficiency.">Very high filtration efficiency.</td><td id="sjs-E23" data-t="s" data-v="Expensive,">Expensive,needs more frequent replace ment in high-dust environments.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Applications</h3><p>Hospital, Pharmaceutical plants, Chip plants, Stockbreeding, Glass screen factory, Photovoltaic plants, PCB factory, Painting booth, Semi-conductor plant, Manufacturing Plant, Machinery Repair Shops, Food &amp; Beverage Factory, Home Use, Construction works, Energy &amp; Mining. Such as:</p><ul><li>Fresh air unit and ventilation system of central air-conditioning.</li><li>Special constant-temperature and constant-humidity air conditioning units for program-controlled exchanges and computer rooms.</li><li>Pre-filtration system for air compressors and gas turbines.</li><li>Pre-filtration system for HEPA filters.</li></ul>						</div>
